[{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0205","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0205.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-3452","title":"Apache OpenOffice oowriter RTF文档处理释放后使用漏洞","description":"OpenOffice.org 的 oowriter 组件在处理特制 RTF 文档中的标签时存在释放后使用漏洞。攻击者可构造恶意 RTF 文件，诱导用户使用 OOo 2.x 或 3.3 之前版本打开，触发已释放内存的访问，导致应用程序崩溃或执行任意代码。该漏洞影响范围广泛，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害严重。用户应升级至 OpenOffice.org 3.3 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-3452"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-01-28T22:00:05Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:22:48Z","remediation":"升级 OpenOffice.org 至 3.3 或更高版本（已在 2011 年 1 月 Oracle CPU 中修复），或迁移至持续维护的 Apache OpenOffice 4.x / LibreOffice 7.x。临时缓解：禁止打开来源不明的 RTF 文档，配置邮件/网关拦截 .rtf 附件，启用 DEP/ASLR 降低利用成功率。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/70713","http://secunia.com/advisories/40775","http://secunia.com/advisories/42999","http://secunia.com/advisories/43065","http://secunia.com/advisories/43105","http://secunia.com/advisories/43118","http://secunia.com/advisories/60799","http://ubuntu.com/usn/usn-1056-1","http://www.cs.brown.edu/people/drosenbe/research.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2151","http://www.gentoo.org/security/en/glsa/glsa-201408-19.xml","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2011:027","http://www.openoffice.org/security/cves/CVE-2010-3451_CVE-2010-3452.html","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/cpuapr2011-301950.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0181.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0182.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/46031","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1025002","http://www.vsecurity.com/resources/advisory/20110126-1","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0230","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0232","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0279","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=640241","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/65031","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2010/CVE-2010-3452.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2010/3xxx/CVE-2010-3452.json","https://github.com/apache/openoffice-org/blob/8229366d1e4d6b49b6b7814c530e13f2c4dcb931/content/security/cves/CVE-2010-3451_CVE-2010-3452.html","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2010-3452","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2b92b509a6091f543702b902d36eba35e2393da1/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-3452.json","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2010.txt","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2010-3452","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-v789-4vxg-r248/GHSA-v789-4vxg-r248.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-3452.md","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/O/openoffice_33.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0205.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0204","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0204.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-3451","title":"Apache OpenOffice Writer RTF文档处理释放后使用漏洞","description":"OpenOffice.org 的 oowriter 组件在处理特制 RTF 文档中的畸形表格时存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送包含恶意表格的 RTF 文件，诱使用户在受影响版本的 OpenOffice.org 中打开该文件，从而触发漏洞。成功利用此漏洞可导致应用程序崩溃（拒绝服务），或在目标系统上以当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 OpenOffice.org 2.x 及 3.3 之前的所有 3.x 版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。用户需升级至 OpenOffice.org 3.3 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-3451"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-01-28T22:00:05Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:22:48Z","remediation":"升级 OpenOffice.org 至 3.3 或更高版本，该版本修复了 RTF 文档解析中的释放后使用漏洞。如无法立即升级，建议禁用 OpenOffice 自动打开 RTF 附件的功能，并在邮件网关层面拦截可疑 RTF 文件，同时限制 oowriter 进程对敏感系统目录的写入权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/70712","http://secunia.com/advisories/40775","http://secunia.com/advisories/42999","http://secunia.com/advisories/43065","http://secunia.com/advisories/43105","http://secunia.com/advisories/43118","http://secunia.com/advisories/60799","http://ubuntu.com/usn/usn-1056-1","http://www.cs.brown.edu/people/drosenbe/research.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2151","http://www.gentoo.org/security/en/glsa/glsa-201408-19.xml","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2011:027","http://www.openoffice.org/security/cves/CVE-2010-3451_CVE-2010-3452.html","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/cpuapr2011-301950.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0181.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0182.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/46031","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1025002","http://www.vsecurity.com/resources/advisory/20110126-1","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0230","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0232","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0279","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=641282","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/65030","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2010/CVE-2010-3451.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2010/3xxx/CVE-2010-3451.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2010/CVE-2010-3451.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2010/CVE-2010-3451.md","https://github.com/apache/openoffice-org/blob/8229366d1e4d6b49b6b7814c530e13f2c4dcb931/content/security/cves/CVE-2010-3451_CVE-2010-3452.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2b92b509a6091f543702b902d36eba35e2393da1/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-3451.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-3451","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2010-3451","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2010/CVE-2010-3451.md","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2010-3451"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0204.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0203","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0203.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-3450","title":"Apache OpenOffice 目录遍历漏洞","description":"OpenOffice.org（OOo）2.x及3.3之前版本中存在多个目录遍历漏洞（CWE-22）。远程攻击者可通过向XSLT JAR过滤器描述文件、扩展（OXT）文件或其他JAR/ZIP压缩包中的条目注入\"..\"（点点）路径穿越序列，在解压过程中实现任意文件覆写。攻击者只需诱使用户打开特制的恶意文档或安装恶意扩展即可触发漏洞，无需其他认证条件。成功利用该漏洞可导致系统文件被覆盖，进而可能实现远程代码执行，CVSS评分高达9.3，危害严重。Apache OpenOffice 3.3版本已修复此问题。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-3450"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-01-28T22:00:05Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:22:47Z","remediation":"升级至 Apache OpenOffice 3.3 或更高版本，该版本修复了 ZIP/JAR 文件解压时的目录遍历问题。如无法立即升级，可在打开来源不明的 OXT、JAR 或 ZIP 文件前进行安全审查，避免解压不可信文档。Linux 用户可通过发行版包管理器（如 apt upgrade openoffice.org）更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/70711","http://secunia.com/advisories/40775","http://secunia.com/advisories/42999","http://secunia.com/advisories/43065","http://secunia.com/advisories/43105","http://secunia.com/advisories/43118","http://secunia.com/advisories/60799","http://ubuntu.com/usn/usn-1056-1","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2151","http://www.gentoo.org/security/en/glsa/glsa-201408-19.xml","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2011:027","http://www.openoffice.org/security/cves/CVE-2010-3450.html","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/cpuapr2011-301950.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0181.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0182.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/46031","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1025002","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0230","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0232","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0279","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=602324","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2010/CVE-2010-3450.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2010/3xxx/CVE-2010-3450.json","https://github.com/apache/openoffice-org/blob/8229366d1e4d6b49b6b7814c530e13f2c4dcb931/content/security/cves/CVE-2010-3450.html","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2010-3450","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2b92b509a6091f543702b902d36eba35e2393da1/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-3450.json","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2010.txt","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2010-3450","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-5jvg-p3q5-62mm/GHSA-5jvg-p3q5-62mm.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-3450.md","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2011/freebsd_openoffice.org0.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0203.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0286","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0286.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4700","title":"PHP MySQLi扩展set_magic_quotes_runtime函数SQL注入漏洞","description":"PHP 5.3.2 和 5.3.3 版本中，set_magic_quotes_runtime 函数与 MySQLi 扩展的 mysqli_fetch_assoc 函数存在交互缺陷。当启用 magic_quotes_runtime 时，该函数未能正确处理通过 mysqli_fetch_assoc 获取的数据，导致此前版本中已被正确过滤的恶意输入可绕过转义机制，使得上下文相关的攻击者更容易通过精心构造的输入实施 SQL 注入攻击，威胁数据库安全。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4700"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-01-18T20:00:10Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:25:22Z","remediation":"升级 PHP 至 5.3.4 或更高版本，该版本修复了 set_magic_quotes_runtime 与 mysqli_fetch_assoc 的交互问题。如无法升级，在 php.ini 中设置 magic_quotes_runtime = Off 并改用参数化查询（Prepared Statements）替代 mysqli_fetch_assoc 直接处理用户输入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugs.php.net/52221","http://www.php.net/ChangeLog-5.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/46056","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/64964","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A12620","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2010/CVE-2010-4700.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4700.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-4700","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-4700.json","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2010.txt","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2010-4700","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2010/CVE-2010-4700.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-773h-jcv3-7rcg/GHSA-773h-jcv3-7rcg.json","https://github.com/zmerry/z-marvel.github.io/blob/581a79f0e7ceb8cdb3e444922154e004cca44bbb/vulbox/webvul/middle/PHP%20set_magic_quotes_runtime%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0SQL%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2010-4700).html","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2010/4xxx/cve-2010-4700.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0286.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0285","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0285.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4699","title":"PHP Iconv iconv_mime_decode_headers 函数编码处理不当漏洞","description":"PHP 5.3.4 之前版本中的 iconv 扩展的 iconv_mime_decode_headers 函数在处理 iconv 和 mbstring（多字节字符串）实现无法识别的字符编码时存在输入验证缺陷。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送包含特制 Subject 头的电子邮件消息，利用 ks_c_5601-1987 等非标准字符集触发该漏洞，导致函数输出不完整的数组，从而可能绕过垃圾邮件检测机制或造成其他未指定的安全影响。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，影响 PHP 5.3.0 至 5.3.3 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4699"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-01-18T20:00:10Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:25:22Z","remediation":"将 PHP 升级至 5.3.4 或更高版本，该版本修复了 iconv 扩展中 iconv_mime_decode_headers 函数对无法识别的字符编码处理不当的问题。如无法立即升级，可在邮件处理逻辑中过滤或校验 Subject 头部的字符编码，避免将不可识别编码直接传入 iconv_mime_decode_headers 函数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugs.php.net/52941","http://coding.derkeiler.com/Archive/PHP/php.general/2007-04/msg00605.html","http://www.php.net/ChangeLog-5.php","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/64963","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A12393","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4699.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-4699","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-4699.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-wx25-9rf2-pq96/GHSA-wx25-9rf2-pq96.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2010-4699","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-4699.json","https://github.com/sdnewhop/grinder/blob/7432531e4a5a4ce3cc8224ac852188ef1d18432d/samples/052019-sdwan-shodan-vulnerabilities/txt/vulnerability.txt","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2010/4xxx/cve-2010-4699.yaml","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/gcf/nopsec_php_5_3_4.nasl","https://github.com/crond-jaist/AutoPentest-DRL/blob/e73507efa984e667614f6f2734219e586d6072e4/Database/ProcessData/fileData_process.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0285.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0284","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0284.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4698","title":"PHP GD扩展栈缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"PHP GD扩展中的imagepstext()函数存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞。当向该函数传递包含大量抗锯齿步进（anti-aliasing steps）参数的恶意数据时，可触发栈缓冲区溢出，导致应用程序崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响PHP 5.2.15之前版本及5.3.4之前版本，攻击者无需认证即可远程触发，但仅能造成服务不可用，无法实现代码执行。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4698"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-01-18T20:00:10Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:25:22Z","remediation":"将 PHP 升级至 5.2.15 或 5.3.4 及以上版本，该漏洞已在 PHP 5.3.4 中通过修复 GD 扩展 imagepstext() 函数的栈缓冲区边界检查得到解决。如无法立即升级，可在 php.ini 中禁用 GD 扩展（extension=gd.so 前加 ; 注释）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugs.php.net/53492","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=133469208622507&w=2","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2010/Dec/180","http://www.php.net/ChangeLog-5.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/45338","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A11939","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2010/CVE-2010-4698.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4698.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-4698","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2010.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-4698.json","https://github.com/zmerry/z-marvel.github.io/blob/581a79f0e7ceb8cdb3e444922154e004cca44bbb/vulbox/webvul/middle/PHP%E6%A0%88%E7%BC%93%E5%86%B2%E5%8C%BA%E6%BA%A2%E5%87%BA%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2010-4698).html","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2010/CVE-2010-4698.md","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2010-4698","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2010/4xxx/cve-2010-4698.yaml","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/gcf/nopsec_php_5_3_4.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2010/POC-AVE-2010-0284.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0284.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0283","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0283.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4697","title":"PHP Zend Engine 释放后重用堆损坏漏洞","description":"PHP Zend 引擎存在释放后重用（Use-after-free）漏洞，当通过引用访问的对象调用 __set、__get、__isset 或 __unset 魔术方法时，引擎未能正确管理对象的内存生命周期，导致已释放的堆内存被再次使用，造成堆内存损坏。攻击者可通过构造特制的 PHP 脚本触发该漏洞，导致目标系统拒绝服务，在特定条件下可能实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 PHP 5.2.15 之前版本及 5.3.4 之前版本，CVSS 评分 6.8，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4697"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-01-18T20:00:10Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:25:22Z","remediation":"立即将 PHP 升级至 5.2.15 及以上版本（5.2.x 分支）或 5.3.4 及以上版本（5.3.x 分支）。如无法立即升级，可在 php.ini 中禁用 __set、__get、__isset、__unset 魔术方法的重载功能，或限制用户传入的引用类型对象参数以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugs.php.net/52879","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=133469208622507&w=2","http://www.php.net/ChangeLog-5.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/45952","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/65310","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A12528","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/933422a5f82611777877a3549b9b8e3c7d70117d/cves/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4697.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-4697","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-4697.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-3x9v-m7wh-wv6x/GHSA-3x9v-m7wh-wv6x.json","https://github.com/zmerry/z-marvel.github.io/blob/581a79f0e7ceb8cdb3e444922154e004cca44bbb/vulbox/webvul/middle/PHP%20Zend%E5%BC%95%E6%93%8E%E9%87%8A%E6%94%BE%E5%90%8E%E9%87%8D%E7%94%A8%E5%A0%86%E7%A0%B4%E5%9D%8F%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2010-4697).html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-4697.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2010/4xxx/cve-2010-4697.yaml","https://github.com/sdnewhop/grinder/blob/7432531e4a5a4ce3cc8224ac852188ef1d18432d/samples/052019-sdwan-vulners-vulnerabilities/txt/vulnerability.txt","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/gcf/nopsec_php_5_2_15.nasl","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2010/CVE-2010-4697"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0283.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0188","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0188.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-2643","title":"GNOME Evince DVI后端整数溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Evince 文档查看器 dvi-backend 组件中的 TFM 字体解析器存在整数溢出漏洞，当处理特制字体与 DVI 文件时，对用于内存分配大小的整数校验不足，导致可向分配范围外写入任意数据。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户打开恶意 DVI 文件（如通过 thumbnailer 自动处理）触发该漏洞，造成任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Evince 2.32 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.6，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2010-2643"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-01-07T19:00:17Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:21:08Z","remediation":"升级 Evince 至 2.91.5 或更高版本（Debian 对应升级至 2.30.3-2，Ubuntu 对应升级至 2.22.2-4~lenny2）。如无法立即升级，建议禁用 DVI 文件的缩略图预览功能，避免 thumbnailer 自动处理恶意 DVI 文件触发漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://git.gnome.org/browse/evince/commit/?id=d4139205b010ed06310d14284e63114e88ec6de2","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2011-January/052910.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2011-January/052995.html","http://lists.mandriva.com/security-announce/2011-01/msg00006.php","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-01/msg00006.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/42769","http://secunia.com/advisories/42821","http://secunia.com/advisories/42847","http://secunia.com/advisories/42872","http://secunia.com/advisories/43068","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2357","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0009.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/45678","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024937","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1035-1","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0029","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0043","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0056","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0097","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0102","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0212","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=666321","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2010/2xxx/CVE-2010-2643.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-2643","https://github.com/GNOME/evince/blob/f52bdd8ac082fdbe649a63c29a633cb83151a8cd/NEWS-security.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-2643.md","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2010-2643","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4bd823fa5ff72ec859371ff3ef0f5e18be2f2c77/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-2643.json","https://github.com/sgidevnet/sgug-rse/blob/32b85d9866610a7d10b228f8f92f1ed8df610b48/packages/evince/evince.spec","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2012/glsa_201111_10.nasl","https://github.com/danigm/evince/blob/df4540cbd071fa697700167bf934be3a8d78c88b/NEWS","https://github.com/cosmicvi/papers-for-windows/blob/d5357ecb4b0565d376e77446eb40728cd1aff8d0/NEWS-security.md.evince"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0188.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0187","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0187.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-2642","title":"t1lib AFM字体解析器堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"t1lib 库的 AFM 字体解析器（parseAFM 函数）中存在基于堆的缓冲区溢出漏洞。当 Evince 文档查看器（2.32 及更早版本）、teTeX 3.0 或 t1lib 5.1.2 处理特制 DVI 文件中的恶意 AFM 字体时，由于对写入堆分配内存缓冲区的数据缺乏充分的边界检查，攻击者可通过构造包含畸形 AFM 字体的 DVI 文件，诱使目标用户通过缩略图预览或打开该文件，触发堆缓冲区溢出，导致任意内存覆盖，最终实现任意代码执行或造成拒绝服务。远程攻击者利用此漏洞需用户交互（打开恶意文件），CVSS 评分 7.6，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2010-2642"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-01-07T19:00:17Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:21:08Z","remediation":"升级 t1lib 至 5.1.2-2 及以上修补版本（Debian/Ubuntu 已提供补丁包），或应用各发行版提供的 CVE-2010-2642 补丁（修复 parseAFM 函数堆缓冲区边界检查）。Evince 用户应升级至 2.32.1 以上版本。如无法升级，可卸载 t1lib 或禁用 DVI 缩略图预览功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://git.gnome.org/browse/evince/commit/?id=d4139205b010ed06310d14284e63114e88ec6de2","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2011-January/052910.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2011-January/052995.html","http://lists.mandriva.com/security-announce/2011-01/msg00006.php","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-04/msg00000.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-1201.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/42769","http://secunia.com/advisories/42821","http://secunia.com/advisories/42847","http://secunia.com/advisories/42872","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2357","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2011:016","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2011:017","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:144","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0009.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/45678","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024937","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1035-1","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0029","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0043","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0056","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0097","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0102","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0193","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0194","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=666318","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/201701-57","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2010/2xxx/CVE-2010-2642.json","https://github.com/BlackArch/blackarch/blob/7d2f58219f79c81c046d4602cbaa5754f01cad08/packages/t1lib/PKGBUILD","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-2642","https://github.com/chromebrew/chromebrew/blob/2c895573a17b1ca79b43599ae31d490867f0829b/packages/t1lib.rb","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/db4dceaf9bd186cb20f62c3a43615b9421200bed/specs/t/t1lib/t1lib.spec","https://github.com/AOSC-Dev/aosc-os-abbs/blob/84919dc5779de5ab1ba71a5bcb07ec5516f134dc/runtime-desktop/t1lib/autobuild/patches/0002-DEBIAN-fix-parseAFM-fix-CVE-2010-2642.patch","https://github.com/gentoo/gentoo/blob/c6155c9d3984a251293b849495f0ef096855e01a/media-libs/t1lib/t1lib-5.1.2-r5.ebuild","https://github.com/pisilinux/main/blob/18492c59d6acebdf5fb2400dc122c134364cd1ec/multimedia/misc/t1lib/files/t1lib-5.1.2-CVE-2010-2642_2011-0433_2011-5244.patch","https://github.com/openbsd/ports/blob/a19ee263597a590ffb3b8ce27967d7f9be7566f6/devel/t1lib/patches/patch-lib_t1lib_parseAFM_c","https://github.com/triton/triton/blob/e647f8a7f34254de0145c35950c1d6f1c93ea3da/pkgs/development/libraries/t1lib/default.nix"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0187.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0186","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0186.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-2641","title":"GNOME Evince VF字体解析器远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Evince 文档查看器的 DVI 后端中 VF 字体解析器存在数组索引错误漏洞。该漏洞源于对 VF 字体文件中数组边界检查不足，攻击者可通过构造恶意的 VF 字体文件并嵌入 DVI 文档中，诱使用户通过 Evince 或缩略图预览器打开该文档，触发函数指针覆盖，导致任意代码执行。成功利用此漏洞可完全控制受影响系统，CVSS 评分 7.6，危害等级高。该漏洞影响 Evince 2.32 及更早版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2010-2641"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-01-07T19:00:17Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:21:08Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Evince 至 2.30.3 及以上版本（Debian 用户安装 DSA-2357-1 更新至 2.30.3-2，RHEL 6 用户安装 RHSA-2011:0009 更新至 evince-2.28.2-14.el6_0.1）。避免打开来源不明的 DVI 文件，不安装不可信字体文件。如无法升级，可禁用 Evince 的 DVI 后端渲染功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://git.gnome.org/browse/evince/commit/?id=d4139205b010ed06310d14284e63114e88ec6de2","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2011-January/052910.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2011-January/052995.html","http://lists.mandriva.com/security-announce/2011-01/msg00006.php","http://secunia.com/advisories/42769","http://secunia.com/advisories/42821","http://secunia.com/advisories/42847","http://secunia.com/advisories/42872","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2357","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0009.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/45678","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024937","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1035-1","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0029","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0043","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0056","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0097","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0102","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=666314","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2010/2xxx/CVE-2010-2641.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-2641","https://github.com/GNOME/evince/blob/f52bdd8ac082fdbe649a63c29a633cb83151a8cd/NEWS-security.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-2641.md","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8