47","http://secunia.com/advisories/42872","http://secunia.com/advisories/43068","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2357","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0009.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/45678","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024937","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1035-1","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0029","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0043","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0056","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0097","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0102","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0212","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=666313","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2010/2xxx/CVE-2010-2640.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-2640","https://github.com/GNOME/evince/blob/f52bdd8ac082fdbe649a63c29a633cb83151a8cd/NEWS-security.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-2640.md","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2010-2640","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7418aa4f1c4590a239ce7ccd2c9efba72e268cc5/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-2640.json","https://github.com/sgidevnet/sgug-rse/blob/32b85d9866610a7d10b228f8f92f1ed8df610b48/packages/evince/evince.spec","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2015/ELSA-2011-0009.nasl","https://github.com/S4Lab/CVulDB/blob/cd399717970dec054dfc912e1e3115f5c895736c/CVE_Diffs/linuxmint__xreader/CVE-2010-2640_a828cb1a5c0835d08a17c86f64d571436f93f980.diff","https://github.com/danigm/evince/blob/df4540cbd071fa697700167bf934be3a8d78c88b/NEWS"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0185.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0110","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0110.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4617","title":"Joomla! JotLoader 组件 目录遍历本地文件包含漏洞","description":"Joomla! 的 JotLoader（com_jotloader）组件 2.2.1 版本存在目录遍历（本地文件包含）漏洞。该组件在处理 index.php 的 section 参数时未对用户输入进行充分过滤与校验，远程攻击者可在该参数中插入 \"../\" 等目录遍历序列，从而读取目标服务器上任意文件（如配置文件、敏感源码等）。攻击无需身份认证，仅需向受影响站点发送特制的 HTTP 请求即可触发，影响所有运行 JotLoader 2.2.1 的 Joomla! 站点，可能导致敏感信息泄露与进一步入侵。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4617"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-12-29T22:33:32Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:25:11Z","remediation":"建议立即将 JotLoader 组件升级至官方发布的 2.2.2 或更高版本（修复了 section 参数的目录遍历过滤）。若暂无法升级，可在 Joomla 后台禁用或卸载 com_jotloader 组件，并在 Web 服务器（如 Apache）配置中通过 mod_security 规则拦截包含 ../ 及 null 字节的 section 参数请求，同时在 php.ini 中设置 open_basedir 限制文件访问范围作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/files/view/96812/joomlajotloader-lfi.txt","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/15791","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/64223","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/15791","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-4617.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2010/CVE-2010-4617.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-4617.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fcc97d3f09074a6534df65087e2097c6145b988b/cves/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4617.json","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/6001-to-7000-templates/cve-2010-4617-2006.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2010-4617.js","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2010-4617_17.yaml","https://github.com/emadshanab/nucleiDB/blob/a06eb8edf2853662c304e3f41f8887b65f56e399/cve-2010-4617-2004.yaml","https://github.com/rjp2525/cve-data/blob/2f3ce5ef3a11f37d0a2e7d88f12b74499612a438/2010/CVE-2010-4617.json","https://github.com/ByteLobo/joomla/blob/32cae09fae17c01b9f6627cf8f2fb46045643162/templatesfuncional/CVE-2010-4617.yaml","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/z-11753.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0110.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0279","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0279.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4397","title":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 整数溢出漏洞","description":"RealPlayer 多媒体播放器程序 [CVE-2010-4397] 存在整数溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过精心 crafting 的恶意 AAC 文件，嵌入特殊 TIT2 原子，在 RealPlayer 的 pnen3260.dll 模块中触发整数溢出。该漏洞影响 RealPlayer 11.0-11.1 版本、RealPlayer SP 1.0-1.1.1 版本、Mac RealPlayer 11.0-11.1 版本及 Linux RealPlayer 11.0.2.1744 版本，允许远程攻击者通过上述文件实现任意代码执行，危及系统的保密性、完整性和可用性。整数溢出导致攻击者可写入越界内存或控制程序执行流程，利用了 RealPlayer 中 AAC TIT2 原子解析代码的边界检查不足的缺陷。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4397"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-12-14T16:00:05Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:24:42Z","remediation":"立即升级 RealPlayer 至 12.0.1.609 或更高版本（Windows/Mac/Linux 均需更新）。若无法立即升级，请卸载 RealPlayer 并改用其他播放器，或在防火墙层面禁止实体从不可信来源加载 AAC 文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/69856","http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/12102010_player/en/","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024861","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-10-269","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/933422a5f82611777877a3549b9b8e3c7d70117d/cves/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4397.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-4397","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c1377