6-5F5DB0B5E23D），并配置 Internet 安全区域为高等级以阻止 ActiveX 脚本执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/69855","http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/12102010_player/en/","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024861","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-10-275","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/933422a5f82611777877a3549b9b8e3c7d70117d/cves/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4396.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-4396","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-4396.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68711f4b9de04c730603adbbe0fe7b126b6784b4/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-4396.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/effb2f348554323580d029ec0e691334888b7fed/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-7jg7-4vvp-f8cv/GHSA-7jg7-4vvp-f8cv.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2010/gb_realplayer_mult_vuln_win_dec10.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x46000/45464/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--44ba4343-497e-425b-bbaf-91884ade7f9b.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/realplayer_12_0_1_609.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2010/CVE-2010-4396.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0278.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0277","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0277.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4395","title":"RealNetworks RealPlayer AAC帧数据条件组件堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 11.0至11.1版本、RealPlayer SP 1.0至1.1.5版本以及Linux RealPlayer 11.0.2.1744版本中的Advanced Audio Coding（AAC）帧数据处理存在基于堆的缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送特制的包含恶意conditional component的AAC媒体文件，诱使用户在RealPlayer中打开该文件，触发堆缓冲区溢出，从而导致任意代码执行。该漏洞CVSS评分9.3，危害等级严重，影响Windows和Linux多平台版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4395"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-12-14T16:00:05Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:24:42Z","remediation":"立即升级 RealPlayer 至 12.0.1.609 或更高版本，该版本已修复 AAC 帧数据条件组件中的堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法升级，可在浏览器中禁用 RealPlayer 插件，或通过防火墙阻止 RealPlayer 对外部媒体的自动连接请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/69854","http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/12102010_player/en/","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024861","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-10-267","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/145038fbd12ba507a810d82f3ca7bed9554ecf9f/cves/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4395.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-4395","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-4395.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68711f4b9de04c730603adbbe0fe7b126b6784b4/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-4395.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/effb2f348554323580d029ec0e691334888b7fed/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-wjpq-x66w-f4mj/GHSA-wjpq-x66w-f4mj.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2010/gb_realplayer_mult_vuln_win_dec10.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_114300_114400.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--055833de-b4e6-4b8b-895b-ddc4c30e44b7.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/